@startuml
title FE-11 Owner Edits Published Review
actor Member
participant ReviewController
participant ReviewService
database ReviewRepository
database ReviewRevisionRepository
Member -> ReviewController : PATCH own review + If-Match-Version
ReviewController -> ReviewService : verify ownership and version
ReviewService -> ReviewRepository : update rating/text keeping PUBLIC
ReviewService -> ReviewRevisionRepository : append revision and audit
ReviewRepository --> ReviewService : new version
ReviewController --> Member : updated safe owner projection
note over Member,ReviewController
Another Member receives safe 403/404.
REMOVED review is not hard-deleted.
end note
@enduml
